    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-15T00:38:05Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To remember a new name, link it to a vivid feature or familiar person; making an association gives your memory another route back to it.</div>
    </content>
