    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#ecc06cecee6f897ada1c400df5cdba1636c1c4fb9e711cd64c3b9bcdc6aebc88</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-15T00:38:05Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A humble yeast cell can turn sugar into carbon dioxide and alcohol; that reliable bit of biology helps bread rise and makes fermentation possible.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
