    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-15T00:38:05Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In under five minutes, choose a familiar object and imagine how people made its equivalent 500 years ago; name the materials, tools and cleverest workaround.</div>
